('ENT_ALCYONEUS','Alcyoneus','Greek','Giant (Gigas)','Giant','giant; Gigantomachy; immortal in his homeland','Greek','archaic Greek','A','candidate_verified_name','Apollodorus Library primary attestation (1.6)',2,false,false,'Giant slain by Heracles (revived when touching his native earth until dragged from it) in the Gigantomachy.','spirit'),
